            "review_text": "Shai N\nLuzon, Philippines279 contributions\n0\nMeh food, meh entertainment\nDec 2016 • Family\nThe food wasnt really that good. It was bland and boring. Service was bad too. It was hard to get the attention of the waitstaff. We were also placed in the Chinese section of the boat since our last name is Chinese. The entertainers only had a few songs which they would sing again and again. For a 2 hour dinner, the songs got pretty annoying really fast. \n\nFor me, just go spend your money on a good meal in town than spending it here.\nRead more\nWritten November 23, 2017",
