            "review_text": "funkstergrrl\nMelbourne, Australia1 contribution\n0\nGreat vegetarian food and beautiful cruise\nOct 2017 • Couples\nWe had a 9 course vegetarian meal that was fantastic and the view was lovely. We also had very attentive, nice staff. WAY too much food for two people, which was a shame as so much was wasted. We moved from the lower level to the top deck as the music was so loud, so I'd recommend asking for the top deck.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 20, 2017",
