            "review_text": "Wtraveller78\nMoncton, Canada6 contributions\n0\nDon't waste your time or money!\nSep 2017 • Couples\nJust arrived from a dinner cruise on this boat. We were upgraded to the 3rd (top) floor but had a set menu different than everyone else. Many vacant seats on the boat but they chose to seat us next to the waiter/waitress counter where they would constantly stack and slam dishes. Food: worse we had during 3 week stay in Vietnam. Spring rolls fried and fresh full of peas, cream of mushroom soup probably made with questionnable condensed milk, fried crab...aka plate full of batter, huge plate of cauliflower in slime, dry cold rice serve in a plastic wrapped coconut fresh out of the microwave? Service: food dropped off before previous course even finished, slow service for drinks, seemed to be a huge hastle when we wanted to pay by card but machine was readily available. As soon as cruise started, staff started removing all vacant seat settings in a very disruptive way. Music: terrible, different on each floor but you can hear all at once. Staff smoking, coughing while handling food. Boat view of city good but choose a different cruise..possibly one without food!\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 20, 2017",
            "rating": 5.0,
