            "review_text": "calidude89\nDallas, Texas2 contributions\n0\nRun away. Would not go if it was free.\nJan 2015 • Friends\nWorst experience in Saigon. Got on the boat by 6:30 as recommended. Finished our food at 7 only to find out the boat wouldn't be leaving until 830. They sell you a 3 hour experience that's really only an hour. The staff treated us like we were an inconvenience. I honestly felt unwelcome from the moment I got on. Food was below average. I saw one guy cough on his hands then serve food right after. There's absolutely nothing to see during the cruise except cargo boats and pollution. They mostly played Chinese music with some Vietnamese music mixed in on the middle deck. There's more variety of entertainment upstairs like Latin dancing, flute, and some amateur magic. I would save your money and time and look elsewhere.\nRead more\nWritten January 7, 2015",
            "rating": 5.0,
